# Genesis MODsuit control unit localization
ent-ClothingModsuitBackBase = base MOD control unit
    .desc = The control unit of a Modular Outerwear Device, a powered suit that protects against various environments.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackBlueShield = BlueShield MOD control unit
    .desc = An Apadyne Technologies security suit that offers greater speed at the cost of carrying capacity.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackSecurity = security MOD control unit
    .desc = An Apadyne Technologies security suit that offers greater speed at the cost of carrying capacity.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackAtmospheric = atmospheric MOD control unit
    .desc = An atmospheric-resistant suit by Nakamura Engineering, offering extreme heat resistance compared to the engineer suit.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackEngineering = engineering MOD control unit
    .desc = Nakamura Engineering's classic engineer-fit suit, with heat and shock resistance.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackRescue = rescue MOD control unit
    .desc = An advanced version of DeForest Medical Corporation's medical suit, designed for quick rescue from the most dangerous environments.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackMedical = medical MOD control unit
    .desc = A lightweight suit by DeForest Medical Corporation that allows for easier movement.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackMining = mining MOD control unit
    .desc = A NanoTrasen mining suit for on-site operations, fitted with accreting ash armor and a spherical form.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackStandard = standard MOD control unit
    .desc = A civilian-class suit by Nakamura Engineering that offers little beyond slightly faster movement.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackClown = cosmohonk MOD control unit
    .desc = A suit by Honk Ltd. that protects against low-humor environments. Most of the technology went toward lowering its power consumption.
ent-ClothingModsuitBackAdmin = administrative MOD control unit
    .desc = A MODsuit made of adminium. Who comes up with these stupid mineral names?
    .suffix = Admeme
ent-ClothingModsuitBackChrono = chrono MOD control unit
    .desc = A suit used to traverse timelines and “correct their course”.
    .suffix = Admeme
ent-ClothingModsuitBackCorp = corporate MOD control unit
    .desc = A fancy, high-tech suit for NanoTrasen's high-ranking officers.
